  "observations": [
    "All 58 catalog regional entries display their corresponding regional appearance, including three Paldean Tauros breeds and White-Striped Basculin.",
    "Subtle shiny differences occur in the source art, including Gengar, Garchomp, Togekiss, Tandemaus, Maushold, Armarouge and Ceruledge; each pair also has distinct independently matched payloads.",
